{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49895","headline":"鱼游春水 · 无名氏","name":"鱼游春水","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秦楼东风里，燕子还来寻旧垒。\n余寒犹峭，红日薄侵罗绮。\n嫩草方抽碧玉茵，媚柳轻窣黄金缕。\n莺转上林，鱼游春水。\n几曲阑干遍倚，又是一番新桃李。\n佳人应怪归迟，梅妆泪洗。\n凤箫声绝沈孤鴈，望断清波无双鲤。\n云山万重，寸心千里。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49895.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49895","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}